<h2 id="why-hawaii">Why side hustles make sense in Hawaii</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Tourism demand.</strong> Visitors fill Waikiki, Maui's resort coasts, Kona and Kauai's North Shore year-round, with peaks in winter (whale season and mainland escapees) and summer. They spend on tours, lessons, photos, transportation and food.</li>
