  <li><strong>Time zone advantage.</strong> Mainland clients start their day before you do, so remote workers can finish client calls by early afternoon and still hit the beach.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you're on Oahu specifically, our guide to the <a href="/best-side-hustles-in-urban-honolulu/">best side hustles in Urban Honolulu</a> goes deeper on neighborhoods and city-specific gigs.</p>

